    "text": "mainstreetmediatn.com\nwebsite\nDickson\nDaryl Cauthen to play Holland Park on Friday\nBy SUBMITTED,\n12 hours agoThe Dickson Parks and Recreation Department’s Music in the Park series continues this Friday, July 11. with local singer/songwriter Daryl Cauthen performing from 6-8 pm on the stage of Holland Park, next door to the Clement Railroad Hotel Museum in downtown Dickson. Bring lawn chairs or blankets, but alcohol is not allowed in city parks.",
